       On  Alpha,  instead of a pair of ggeettggiidd() and ggeetteeggiidd() system calls, a
       single ggeettxxggiidd() system call is provided, which returns a pair of  real
       and effective GIDs.  The glibc ggeettggiidd() and ggeetteeggiidd() wrapper functions
